I’ve now separated three layers that are easy to conflate: the v2 docs contract, the exact 1.18.16 official source, and a third-party tool-search fork. The official package implements a bounded lexical catalog inside Code Mode; it does not expose the fork’s `MCP.toolsMeta()` API. I’m tracing our composition and rendering paths next so the recommendation preserves our child-tool identity rather than treating UI as an afterthought.
