+### Current MCP grants
+
+`mcpGrants.ts` is 168 lines.
+
+Its file contract explicitly says default deny and exact matching at lines 3-8.
+
+It rejects glob metacharacters at lines 10-39.
+
+`allowedTools` is an exact list at lines 41-47.
